    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="El. 49.6">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> El. 49.6</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{I} Of ðissum anum dome mon mæg geðencean, þæt he æghwelcne on ryht gedemeð; ne ðearf he nanra domboca oþerra. Geðence he, þæt he nanum men ne deme þæt he nolde ðæt he him demde, gif he ðone dóm ofer hine sohte.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">From this one judgment one may reason in such a way that he judge each man rightly; he requires no other book of laws. Let him think that he judge no man in a manner that he would not be judged by him, if he sought judgment over him.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">I. On ðyssum anum dome mon mæg geþencan, ðæt he æghwylcne (dom) on ryht gedeme; ne þearf he nanre domboca oþera. Geðænce he, ðæt he nanum men ne deme þæt he nolde ðæt man him demde, gif he þone dom ofer hine ahte.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
